HEXARA — Island Settlers
========================

This project is an ORIGINAL implementation of a hex-tile settlement board game.
It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or licensed from the publishers of any
commercial game. Trademarks and copyrighted artwork of any commercial game are
the property of their respective owners; none of those assets are used here.

All source code, game rules implementation, original SVG artwork
(under `client/assets/`), and documentation in this repository are original
works released under the terms of the MIT License (see `LICENSE`).

The project name "HEXARA — Island Settlers" is an original name chosen for
this implementation.

Third-party tool used at runtime (not redistributed):
- `cloudflared` — Cloudflare Tunnel client (Apache 2.0). When you run
  `share.py`, it is downloaded on demand from Cloudflare's official GitHub
  releases into `./bin/` and executed locally; the binary is not bundled or
  redistributed with this repository.
